# title: Table draft survives backdrop and background close; apply writes to the original note
# engines: cm
# timeout: 180
open:$V\table-acceptance.md
uclick:源码@RadioButton
uclick:~HeaderAlpha
key:ctrl+home
key:ctrl+alt+t
ms:1500
uia:table.dialog|表格编辑器
udump:table-open
uclick:~HeaderAlpha@DataItem
key:ctrl+a
type:EditedHeader
ms:400
click:100,730
uia:table.backdrop-keeps-draft|~EditedHeader
uclick:~EditedHeader@DataItem
key:ctrl+w
ms:500
uia:table.close-prompts|有未保存的修改
key:ctrl+w
ms:500
uia:table.repeat-close-preserves-prompt|有未保存的修改
fileeq:table.disk-unchanged|table-acceptance.md|| HeaderAlpha | HeaderBeta |\n| --- | --- |\n| CellOne | CellTwo |\n
uclick:取消@Button
ms:400
uia:table.continue-preserves-draft|~EditedHeader
uclick:~EditedHeader@DataItem
key:esc
ms:400
uia:table.escape-prompts|有未保存的修改
uclick:应用@Button
ms:600
key:ctrl+s
ms:1000
filehas:table.apply-original-note|table-acceptance.md|EditedHeader
filehas:table.other-cells-preserved|table-acceptance.md|CellOne
uia:table.background-tab-retained|~table-acceptance.md@TabItem
shot:table-applied
